"id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001:m0144","start":144,"end":145,"surface":"嗣","kind":"person","person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001:m0167","start":167,"end":168,"surface":"範","kind":"person","person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001:m0174","start":174,"end":175,"surface":"景","kind":"person","person_id":"5d1_8jg_amy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001:m0176","start":176,"end":178,"surface":"任約","kind":"person","person_id":"yka_ywr_r2n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001:m0183","start":183,"end":184,"surface":"範","kind":"person","person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001:m0185","start":185,"end":187,"surface":"之橫","kind":"person","person_id":"4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001:m0194","start":194,"end":195,"surface":"範","kind":"person","person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001:m0197","start":197,"end":199,"surface":"之橫","kind":"person","person_id":"4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete","book_id":"b-liangshu-028","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete-ws1511902"},{"id":"c-liangshu-043-weican:p003","text":"先是，安北將軍鄱陽王範亦自合肥遣西豫州刺史裴之高與其長子嗣，帥江西之衆赴京師，屯於張公洲，待上流諸軍至。是時，之高遣船渡仲禮，與合軍進屯王游苑。粲建議推仲禮爲大都督，報下流衆軍。裴之高自以年位恥居其下，乃云：「柳節下是州將，何須我復鞭板？」累日不決。粲乃抗言於衆曰：「今者同赴國難，義在除賊，所以推柳司州者，政以久捍邊疆，先爲侯景所憚；且士馬精銳，無出其前。若論位次，柳在粲下；語其年齒，亦少於粲，直以社稷之計，不得復論。今日形勢，貴在將和；若人心不同，大事去矣。裴公朝之舊齒，年德已隆，豈應復挾私情，以沮大計。粲請爲諸君解釋之。」乃單舸至之高營，切讓之曰：「前諸將之議，豫州意所未同，卽二宮危逼，猾寇滔天，臣子當戮力同心，豈可自相矛盾！豫州必欲立異，鋒鏑便有所歸。」之高垂泣曰：「吾荷國恩榮，自應帥先士卒，顧恨衰老，不能效命，企望柳使君共平凶逆，謂衆議已從，無俟老夫耳。若必有疑，當剖心相示。」於是諸將定議，仲禮方得進軍。","text_layer":"recei